<section class="cd-shell"><header><div><small>RECOVER YOUR WORK</small><h2>Crimson Drafts</h2></div><span>{{count}} recovery copies</span></header><div class="cd-toolbar"><input name="search" aria-label="Search drafts" value="{{query}}" placeholder="Search items, feats, actors, or any module…"><button type="button" data-action="refresh">Refresh</button><button type="button" data-action="import">Import JSON</button></div><p>Editing states are kept on this device for this world and user. Restore the window, inspect captured data, or export a recovery copy. Specialized editors may need their own module to restore all internal state.</p>{{#if error}}<div role="alert" class="cd-error">{{error}}</div>{{/if}}<div class="cd-list">{{#each records}}<article><div><small>{{adapter}} · {{date}}</small><h3>{{title}}</h3><p>{{summary}}</p></div><nav><button type="button" data-action="restore" data-id="{{id}}">Restore</button><button type="button" data-action="inspect" data-id="{{id}}">Inspect</button><button type="button" data-action="export" data-id="{{id}}">Export</button><button type="button" data-action="discard" data-id="{{id}}" title="Delete only this recovery copy">Discard</button></nav></article>{{else}}<div class="cd-empty">Open an editing window and make changes. Recovery copies will appear here.</div>{{/each}}</div></section>
